{"job_post_list": [{"id": "7686025886616832299", "title": "高级关卡策划（大世界关卡向/都市生活模拟）", "sub_title": null, "description": "1. 负责大世界区域规划、空间布局与动线设计，结合玩法需求，打造自然、可信且富有探索乐趣的场景体验。\n2. 负责关卡方案、白盒搭建、内容配置与调试迭代，推动关卡从原型验证到完整落地。\n3. 与其他策划、美术及程序团队协作，持续优化关卡体验、制作流程与工具。", "requirement": "1. 具备至少 2~3 年关卡设计经验，或至少 1 个 3D 游戏项目的关卡设计与制作经验。\n2. 熟悉大世界游戏，尤其是都市题材；深度体验过生活模拟类游戏，对空间组织、探索节奏与场景互动有自己的理解。\n3. 熟悉 Unreal Engine 或 Unity 等商业游戏引擎，具备独立设计关卡、搭建白盒及验证迭代的能力。\n4. 具备良好的设计表达、沟通协作与主动推进能力，能够跨职能推动方案落地。\n5. 有相关品类开发经验、完整区域交付经验，或建筑、城市规划、地编背景者优先。\n\n**请随简历附上个人游戏经历及相关作品，并注明个人负责内容。**", "job_category": null, "city_info": null, "recruit_type": {"id": "101", "name": "全职", "en_name": "Full-time", "i18n_name": "全职", "depth": 2, "parent": {"id": "1", "name": "社招", "en_name": "Experienced", "i18n_name": "社招", "depth": 1, "parent": null, "children": null, "active_status": 1, "selectability": 1}, "children": null, "active_status": 1, "selectability": 1}, "publish_time": 1789542377032, "job_hot_flag": null, "job_subject": null, "code": null, "department_id": null, "job_function": {"id": "7233699008626133287", "name": "游戏策划", "en_name": null, "i18n_name": "游戏策划", "parent_id": null, "index": null, "active_status": null, "biz_create_time": null, "biz_modify_time": null, "parent": {"id": "7233694510365804811", "name": "产品", "en_name": null, "i18n_name": "产品", "parent_id": null, "index": null, "active_status": null, "biz_create_time": null, "biz_modify_time": null, "parent": null}}, "job_process_id": "7055360233992374564", "recommend_id": null, "city_list": [{"code": "CT_125", "name": "上海", "en_name": "Shanghai", "location_type": null, "i18n_name": "上海", "py_name": null, "mdm_code": null, "node_status": null}], "job_post_info": {"id": null, "job_id": null, "title": null, "sub_title": null, "address_id": null, "address": null, "city": null, "education": null, "experience": null, "description": null, "requirement": null, "min_salary": null, "max_salary": null, "currency": null, "head_count": null, "crator_id": null, "expiry_time": null, "progress": null, "department_id": null, "job_type": null, "recruitment_type": {"id": "101", "name": "全职", "en_name": "Full-time", "i18n_name": "全职", "depth": 2, "parent": {"id": "1", "name": "社招", "en_name": "Experienced", "i18n_name": "社招", "depth": 1, "parent": null, "children": null, "active_status": 1, "selectability": 1}, "children": null, "active_status": 1, "selectability": 1}, "job_process_time": null, "job_in_charge_user_id": null, "biz_create_time": null, "HighlightList": null, "JobChannelPublishList": null, "required_degree": null, "never_expiry": null, "job_hot_flag": null, "subject": null, "sequence": null, "min_level": null, "max_level": null, "job_post_object_value_map": {}, "code": null, "job_active_status": null, "job_process_type": null, "biz_modify_time": null, "job_function": null, "job_process": null, "job_process_id": null, "job_category": null, "address_list": [{"id": "7112142104814616577", "name": "华鑫慧享城 B8栋2F（宜州路188号）", "en_name": "", "district": {"district_code": "DS_43", "name": "徐汇区", "en_name": "Xuhui", "i18n_name": "徐汇区"}, "city": {"city_code": "CT_125", "name": "上海", "en_name": "Shanghai", "i18n_name": "上海", "py_name": "shanghai"}, "state": {"state_code": "ST_47", "name": "上海", "en_name": "Shanghai", "i18n_name": "上海"}, "country": {"country_code": "CN_1", "name": "中国大陆", "en_name": "Chinese Mainland", "i18n_name": "中国大陆"}, "i18n_name": "华鑫慧享城 B8栋2F（宜州路188号）", "active_status": 1}], "city_list": null, "correlation_job_list": null, "tag_list": null, "department": null, "job_storefront_mode": null, "storefront_list": null, "target_major_list": null, "schema": null, "job_post_process_time_list": null, "job_level_id_list": null}, "storefront_mode": 1, "storefront_list": null, "process_type": 1}, {"id": "7685236615518669107", "title": "关卡美术师（欧美SLG）", "sub_title": null, "description": "1、负责SLG项目大世界地貌、城建场景、战斗地形三大核心系统的地编制作、搭建与迭代优化，保障全场景美术品质统一。\n2、精准理解整体设计意图与美术风格，独立完成地形雕琢、场景布局、材质制作、光影调校，高效落地标准化美术效果。\n3、结合SLG城建、行军、战斗，地形对战等核心玩法，完成场景结构、地形参数、区域功能适配，兼顾美术表现与玩法体验。\n4、按需承接场景3D建模相关工作，完成场景物件、地貌结构的制作与优化，补齐场景制作环节。\n5、负责场景资源规整、轻量化优化、版本维护，严格遵守项目规范，配合团队稳定迭代与版本攻坚。", "requirement": "一、核心硬性技能\n1、精通 Substance Designer（核心必备）：能够独立制作地表，建筑，大地图渲染等偏写实场景PBR材质，熟练完成纹理烘焙、参数调校、材质优化与资源复用，具备独立产出高品质全套场景材质的能力。\n2、精通 Unity 引擎地编工作（核心必备）：熟练使用Unity完成大世界地形编辑、场景搭建、光影烘焙、后期调色、配合TA进行资源管理、性能优化，熟练适配SLG全场景制作流程。\n3、具备扎实的3D建模能力：可独立完成场景基础模型、地貌及配套物件建模，能够按需承接建模工作，支撑场景完整落地。\n4、熟悉SLG大世界、城建、战斗三大系统制作逻辑，懂玩法体验适配、懂场景模块化搭建、懂美术性能优化。\n\n二、核心能力要求\n1、具备优秀的场景美术审美，对对照建筑偏写实风格的质感、层次、氛围有良好把控力，产出风格统一、品质稳定。\n2、具备极强的设计意图理解与落地能力，能够精准捕捉整体设计思路与风格方向，可将抽象需求高效转化为可落地、符合项目标准的成品效果，减少反复调整。\n\n三、综合素质要求\n1、责任心强、自律度高，对工作品质、进度、结果高度负责，主动自查、主动兜底、严谨细致。\n2、团队认同感强、能与团队同心共进，稳定性高、愿意长期深耕项目，积极配合团队攻坚与迭代，服从整体项目节奏。\n3、主观能动性强，主动发现问题、优化资源、推进工作，不被动等待安排。\n\n投递要求\n简历附带作品集，需包含：Substance Designer材质案例、Unity地编完整场景案例、SLG大世界/城建/战斗场景作品、3D场景建模案例。", "job_category": null, "city_info": null, "recruit_type": {"id": "101", "name": "全职", "en_name": "Full-time", "i18n_name": "全职", "depth": 2, "parent": {"id": "1", "name": "社招", "en_name": "Experienced", "i18n_name": "社招", "depth": 1, "parent": null, "children": null, "active_status": 1, "selectability": 1}, "children": null, "active_status": 1, "selectability": 1}, "publish_time": 1789358754460, "job_hot_flag": null, "job_subject": null, "code": null, "department_id": null, "job_function": {"id": "7510181147096893747", "name": "3D地编", "en_name": null, "i18n_name": "3D地编", "parent_id": null, "index": null, "active_status": null, "biz_create_time": null, "biz_modify_time": null, "parent": {"id": "7233694862792870177", "name": "艺术", "en_name": null, "i18n_name": "艺术", "parent_id": null, "index": null, "active_status": null, "biz_create_time": null, "biz_modify_time": null, "parent": null}}, "job_process_id": "7109995820649826597", "recommend_id": null, "city_list": [{"code": "CT_125", "name": "上海", "en_name": "Shanghai", "location_type": null, "i18n_name": "上海", "py_name": null, "mdm_code": null, "node_status": null}], "job_post_info": {"id": null, "job_id": null